Follow sfall's DrugsFile, and give the scripts set_drugs_data

For each drug in the file ddraw.ini names: how many of its effects may wait at once, how long its withdrawal lasts, and for a drug the engine does not know, the global variable of its addiction and how the character screen shows it, as sfall's Drugs module does. set_drugs_data changes the first two, until a new game. Fallout Yesterday adds two drugs this way.
